      "packageName": "com.hrbons.fastlane",
      "name": "Fast Lane",
      "summary": "Life-simulation in the spirit of Jones in the Fast Lane - Dutch, tiny, native, offline",
      "description": "A tiny, native Android life-simulation in the spirit of Jones in the Fast Lane (Sierra, 1990). Walk a generated city - your flat, two schools, an employment office, two employers, a supermarket, a department store, a bank - and build up wealth, education, happiness and career within a limited number of weeks, against an AI rival that plays the same city by the same rules. Every week rotates: which vacancies are open, which school teaches, where the queues are, and how prices and wages move, so there is no single memorised route. Plus a seeded daily challenge that is the same city for everyone, statistics, a daily streak and earnable coins. Pure Kotlin on the Android framework only: no ads, no tracking, no third-party libraries. The interface is in Dutch.",
      "license": "Proprietary",
      "categories": ["Games"],
      "added": 1785273640000,
      "lastUpdated": 1785273640000,
      "suggestedVersionName": "1.0",
      "suggestedVersionCode": "1"
    },
    {
      "packageName": "com.hrbons.wordfinder",
      "name": "Word Swipe",
      "summary": "Swipe letters to fill a crossword - tiny, native, offline",
      "description": "A tiny, native Android word game: a wheel of letters at the bottom, a crossword grid at the top. Every word in a level can be spelled from one base word - swipe across the wheel to spell it and the grid fills in. Valid words that are not in the grid count as bonus words and pay coins, which buy hints. Dutch word lists with offline definitions, a seeded daily puzzle that is the same for everyone, plus free play, statistics and a daily streak. Pure Kotlin on the Android framework only: no ads, no tracking, no third-party libraries.",
      "license": "Proprietary",
      "categories": ["Games"],
      "added": 1785273640000,
